5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be thorough about the costs and logistics this time. I'll look into the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the group transport receipts from the last three years.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll check the accounts from the two clubs that went inland and the attendance sheets for the away camps to see if the travel is actually worth it.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I'll look into the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and also the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds and the membership list against first-train times to get a better sense of the baseline expenses.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'll check what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the vacation timetable for the club's own hall.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Since everyone has already picked their two items, I think we have a solid plan for the research phase. Let's move forward.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I agree with Shion. I'm curious to see what we find out, so let's get started.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research so we can make an informed decision.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, let's just get the data first. I'll see if staying on campus is even a viable option for us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm already on it. I'll make sure to be very careful when I look through the application process for the public bookings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll do the same with the membership list. It's important to know exactly who can make it and at what cost.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll get the seniors' take on the mixing situation. We can't just focus on the money; the atmosphere matters too.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
21,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll make sure to cross-reference the rates with the train times. Let's wrap this up and start the research.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Sounds good. I'm ready to dig into this. Let's see what we find.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
