57,3,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
58,3,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"The options are the Mountain Training Centre, Campus Intensive, and the Coastal Lodge. Given the risks of non-refundable deposits, I'm leaning toward the Mountain Training Centre for its cost-efficiency.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Shion,,The Mountain Training Centre sounds like a nightmare for sleep and attendance. I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge; it's the only way to ensure quality rest and actual bonding.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge too. It has staff for meals, so no one has to spend their training time cooking, and it avoids that scary nine-page application.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge. While the deposit is a risk, the low cost of public beds doesn't matter if the application process is a disaster and the training hours are ruined.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge. If we want the year-groups to actually mix and avoid the mess of the campus hall, it's the only real choice left.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"I see that everyone else is in agreement. While I still have concerns about the financial risk of the non-refundable deposit, the consensus is clear. I'll change my vote to the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,It's a relief we're all on the same page. Prioritizing the quality of the experience and the well-being of the members is the logical choice for the club's long-term health.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm just glad we found a way to make it fun for everyone without making the organizers suffer. I'm really looking forward to the Coastal Lodge!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I'm glad we've reached a consensus. We'll just have to be very strict about the final headcount to ensure the club account doesn't suffer from any last-minute cancellations.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. Let's just make sure we get a firm commitment from everyone early on. I'm glad we're finally doing this right.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
